Check a file and show diagnostics with rich formatting

Usage: souc diagnostics check [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  Input file

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>          Output format (human, json, sarif) [default: human]
      --max-errors <MAX_ERRORS>  Maximum number of errors to show [default: 50]
      --show-type-diff           Show type diff for type errors
      --show-trace               Show unification trace for type errors
  -v, --verbose                  Enable verbose output
  -h, --help                     Print help
